# The Dockerfile copies each path it wants by name, so this is about keeping the
# build context small - except .env, which stays listed so a broader COPY could
# never bake the model key into an image. Caches sit at any depth (api/ holds its
# own __pycache__), and a bare pattern only matches at the root, hence **/.
.env
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.pyc
.venv/
*.egg-info/
tests/
